Package: openkache
Version: @VERSION@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: OpenKache maintainers <maintainers@openkache.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/openkache/openkache
Description: SSD-backed cache server and command-line client
 OpenKache exposes Redis-compatible GET, SET, and DEL over RESP/TCP and the
 OpenKache Gate 0 protocol over QUIC/UDP. The package includes the preview
 server, interactive CLI, configuration example, and an optional systemd unit.
